   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media Task Force SP</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Media Task Force SP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Media Task Force inom Stabilitetspakten skall bl a implementera mediastrategier i regionen och skapa ett samarbete. Man ska st&#xf6;dja press- och yttrandefrihet samt koordinera givarna inom mediasektorn. Sekretariatet vid Stabilitetspakten drivs numera av Press Now, Holland.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Stability Pact Media Task Force should e g implement media strategies in the region and create a co-operation. They should support freedom of press and expression and co-ordinate media donors in the region. The Stability Pact MTF secretariat is now managed by Press Now, Holland.</narrative>
  </description>
